            "state": "translated",
            "value": "మీ మొదటి నోట్ చేర్చడానికి ఒక వచనాన్ని నొక్కండి"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the mini player pinned to the bottom of this screen — its artwork, title, and background all morph into the full-player layout below using one shared @Namespace. Tap the close button on the full player to collapse it back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap the mini player pinned to the bottom of this screen — its artwork, title, and background all morph into the full-player layout below using one shared @Namespace. Tap the close button on the full player to collapse it back."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "इस स्क्रीन के नीचे लगे मिनी प्लेयर पर टैप करें — उसका आर्टवर्क, शीर्षक और पृष्ठभूमि एक साझा @Namespace से नीचे दिए पूर्ण प्लेयर लेआउट में बदल जाते हैं। वापस छोटा करने के लिए पूर्ण प्लेयर पर बंद करें बटन दबाएँ।"
          }
        },
        "kn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap the mini player pinned to the bottom of this screen — its artwork, title, and background all morph into the full-player layout below using one shared @Namespace. Tap the close button on the full player to collapse it back."
          }
        },
        "ml": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ഈ സ്ക്രീനിന്റെ താഴെയുള്ള മിനി പ്ലേയറിൽ ടാപ്പ് ചെയ്യുക — അതിന്റെ ആർട്ട്‌വർക്ക്, ശീർഷകം, പശ്ചാത്തലം എന്നിവ ഒരു പങ്കിട്ട @Namespace ഉപയോഗിച്ച് താഴെയുള്ള ഫുൾ പ്ലേയർ ലേഔട്ടിലേക്ക് മാറും. തിരികെ ചുരുക്കാൻ ഫുൾ പ്ലേയറിലെ അടയ്ക്കുക ബട്ടണിൽ ടാപ്പ് ചെയ്യുക."
          }
        },
        "ta": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap the mini player pinned to the bottom of this screen — its artwork, title, and background all morph into the full-player layout below using one shared @Namespace. Tap the close button on the full player to collapse it back."
          }
        },
        "te": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ఈ స్క్రీన్ అడుగున ఉన్న మినీ ప్లేయర్‌ను నొక్కండి — దాని ఆర్ట్‌వర్క్, శీర్షిక, నేపథ్యం అన్నీ ఒకే @Namespace ఉపయోగించి కింది ఫుల్ ప్లేయర్ లేఅవుట్‌గా మారతాయి. తిరిగి కుదించడానికి ఫుల్ ప్లేయర్‌లోని మూసివేత బటన్‌ను నొక్కండి."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to retry": {
